WEBVTT

00:00:29.192 --> 00:00:30.985
it’s not just taking care of a child;

00:00:30.985 --> 00:00:32.570
it’s keeping a household running,

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:33.571
washing dishes,

00:00:33.571 --> 00:00:34.572
doing laundry,

00:00:34.572 --> 00:00:36.115
it’s keeping the schedule tight.

00:00:36.115 --> 00:00:40.828
We again assume that that work
will be done by a wife who’s at home.

00:00:40.912 --> 00:00:46.709
The reality has progressed
beyond where we’re at policy-wise.

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:50.046
Most people need
multiple sources of income,

00:00:50.046 --> 00:00:52.632
women want to work outside of the home --

00:00:52.632 --> 00:00:55.510
we’re still expected to do
all of the same things.

00:00:55.551 --> 00:00:59.639
And so now we outsource
a lot of that parenting work

00:00:59.639 --> 00:01:00.723
to other women,